    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it triggers.  Even if you use this card's [When Digivolving] effect to reduce the DP of an opponent's Digimon to 0, it isn't yet deleted at that time. After you play EX8-062 [Piedmon ACE] from your trash and this effect is resolved, then all Digimon with 0 DP are deleted at the same timing.  Digimon with a DP of 0 are deleted after playing EX8-062 [Piedmon ACE], then EX8-062 [Piedmon ACE]'s [All Turns] effect will trigger.",
        "question": "I used this card's [When Digivolving] effect to reduce the DP of an opponent's Digimon to 0, then I played EX8-062 [Piedmon ACE].  Does that EX8-062 [Piedmon ACE]'s [All Turns] effect trigger at such times?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
